WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.230
Your first room is The Signal.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:12.804
Open your Whop library to find the First Vision, Dispatches, the calendar, and the Sanctuary.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:16.891
The Signal remains free forever, with no card and no renewal.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:18.378
Take your time here.

00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:23.580
The Watcher is optional if you later want to follow a full monthly cycle.
